00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.270
So recently on the
Kubernetes blog,

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:58.230
there is a really cool
tool called Kompose.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.800
That was a great alliteration.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.160
Kompose with a K.
So if anyone who

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.559
has worked with Docker
before-- quite often, people,

00:02:05.559 --> 00:02:06.850
they start working with Docker.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.120
